# Kubernetes logs

## Defaults

1. Prefer tail/limited lines over full history dumps.
2. On CrashLoopBackOff, also fetch **previous** container logs when MCP
   supports it.
3. Redact secrets and tokens from excerpts.
4. Name the container when a pod has more than one.
